# Normalise line endings in the repository. The local core.autocrlf setting varies
# by machine, so pin it here instead: everything is stored with LF, and only
# Windows working copies get CRLF. Without this, a Windows checkout rewrites files
# to CRLF and every diff shows the whole file as changed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The bundle payload and images are binary; never touch them.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.traineddata binary
*.zip binary

# Keep the generated bundle out of diffs even if someone builds locally.
/build/ export-ignore